         </dc:creator>
         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The FSL336LR integrated Pulse Width Modulator (PWM) and SENSEFETÂ® is specifically designed for high-performance offline buck, buck-boost, and non-isolation flyback Switched Mode Power Supplies (SMPS) with minimal external components.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
